\text{Aim}\rightarrow\text{Shot}\rightarrow\text{Miss vector}
\rightarrow\text{Correction}\rightarrow\text{Next shot}

Meta Kentucky Windage generalizes that:

\boxed{
\text{Intent}
\rightarrow
\text{Deployment}
\rightarrow
\text{Trajectory}
\rightarrow
\text{Observed Delta}
\rightarrow
\text{Infer Environment}
